Ever since I was little, I have been God’s goddaughter.

14
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:46,750
And she looks pretty

15
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:48,470
Bon voyage

16
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:49,870
Become a foreign security officer

17
00:00:49,870 --> 00:00:51,950
Which window has God closed for me?

18
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:53,430
Now I realize it is

19
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:55,430
I've never truly felt human

20
00:01:01,570 --> 00:01:02,570
what did you just say

21
00:01:02,570 --> 00:01:03,570
I didn't hear clearly
